description:
Large 3 Bedroom Apartment for Rent in Mid-City in Los Angeles. 

- BRAND NEW Floors throughout apartment; 

- FIBER INTERNET - Super FAST

- Designer bathroom subway tiles on the walls and a BRAND NEW WALL-HUNG vanity with granite top;

- Spacious Kitchens with white tile countertops, gas range (oven and stove), microwave, and tile floors; - AND BRAND NEW REFRIGERATOR

- Laundry IN THE UNIT OR BRING YOUR OWN LAUNDRY AND USE THE HOOKUPS in the kitchen; 

- Double Paned Glass Windows throughout; 

- Very Bright Living Room with lots of windows ; 

- Custom Designer Finishes, like white crown molding and baseboards and white walls; 

- Air Conditioning and Heating in all bedrooms and the living room; 

- One parking space; 

- Spacious Balcony; 

- Updated Electrical and Copper Plumbing throughout building with all new fixtures, outlets, switches and faucets; 

- Building has been freshly painted and looks new, clean and presentable; 

- Neighborhood is quiet - 2 Beautiful and big Parks within 2 blocks, 

- Lots of schools in the neighborhood: Pico Pre-School; Queen Anne Elementary; Wilton Place Elementary School , Alta Loma Elementary School, Johnnie L. Cochran Jr. Middle School, Pio Pico Middle School ; Los Angeles High School; 

- Limitless Hot water with modern gas water heater. 



3 Bedroom with 1 Bath - upstairs unit 

Many breeds of dogs are allowed.

Comments on images: 

-Front of Building - beautifully landscaped WITH NEW GRASS

-Side Balcony - Similar to the one pictured - but is on the second floor 

-Front Door leads to stairs and into both the Living Room and Dining Room - has walnut stained oak flooring - new paint on walls and ceiling and completely cleaned up

-Kitchen - with microwave and stove/oven/range and white tile counter tops - Laundry area is on the left side, not visible in photo 

-Bathroom with granite top vanity, floor tiles, and subway tiles in shower, BRAND NEW FLOORING AND WALL HUNG AND MODERN VANITY

-All Rooms - all have NEW FLOORING - bright windows and spacious closets

